1. passport_bridge: verify_passport fails closed when no trusted
   Ed25519 public key is configured (structural_only=True is the
   documented dev/test escape hatch only).
2. passport mint: no-passport demo path now requires explicit
   CNOTA_DEMO_MODE=1 (default off) — public API cannot queue mints
   without a verified passport.
3. Virtue scores are read server-side (services/cnota_scores.py),
   client-supplied virtue_scores field removed from MintRequest.

Adds backend/tests/test_passport_gate.py: 12 tests (fail-closed key,
signature pass/fail, tamper, replay window, demo gate, server scores).
All 12 passing on Python 3.11.

ConstitutionalAudit: audit-20260915-technical-security :: L1_SECURITY ::
enforcementBinding=REQUIRE_HUMAN -> fixes applied pre-RDV-Phase-1.
